# What `git archive` ships to production (see CLAUDE.md "Deployen"). Deploys
# use `git archive`, not a raw rsync of the working tree, so anything that
# isn't needed to serve a member request never reaches the live server —
# tests, CI config, docs, dev scripts, dotfiles.
/tests export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/bin export-ignore
/docs export-ignore
/*.md export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/composer.json export-ignore
/composer.lock export-ignore
